Pin a static version and drop the uv-dynamic-versioning build dependency.

Upstream builds the version from git tags via uv-dynamic-versioning, which is
not available in OpenEmbedded. Pin the released version and use plain hatchling.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe-specific packaging; upstream uses VCS-derived version]

